Qwen3.5-397B: the experts alone at 4.5 bpw are 60 × 512 × 12.58M × 4.5/8 = 217.4 GB, so the file is about 209 GiB (224 GB). The per-expert size is 6.75 MiB = 7.08 MB, so routed bytes are 4.25 GB per token.

Hugging Face API, 2026-10-15:
- ubergarm smol-IQ1_KT: 235.09 GB for K2.6 and K2.5, 235.56 GB for K2-Instruct (ik_llama.cpp only);
- Unsloth Kimi-K2.5 UD-TQ1_0: 239.54 GB (mainline llama.cpp);
- K2-Thinking UD-TQ1_0: 246.84 GB × 8 / 1,026.41B = 1.924 bpw, with routed experts at 1.886 bpw.
